{"b":"Ps","c":130,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Out of the depths have I cried unto thee, O LORD.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.42.7",11,"r"],["Heb.5.7",10,"r"],["Ps.69.14",7,"r"],["Ps.69.15",7,"r"],["Jonah.2.2",7,"w"],["Jonah.2.4",7,"r"],["Ps.71.20",6,"w"],["Ps.69.1",6,"r"],["Ps.69.2",6,"r"],["Ps.116.3",6,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Lord, hear my voice: let thine ears be attentive to the voice of my supplications.","x":[["2Chr.6.40",8,"w"],["Ps.61.1",7,"r"],["Ps.61.2",7,"r"],["Isa.37.17",6,"r"],["Dan.9.17",5,"w"],["Dan.9.19",5,"r"],["Neh.1.11",5,"w"],["Neh.1.6",5,"w"],["Ps.28.2",4,"e"],["Ps.17.1",4,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"If thou, LORD, shouldest mark iniquities, O Lord, who shall stand?","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O Lord”."},"x":[["Ps.143.2",15,"r"],["Ps.76.7",11,"w"],["Rom.3.20",11,"r"],["Rom.3.24",11,"r"],["John.8.7",9,"r"],["John.8.9",9,"r"],["Job.10.14",8,"r"],["Rev.6.17",8,"w"],["Nah.1.6",7,"w"],["Mal.3.2",7,"w"]]},{"n":4,"t":"But there is forgiveness with thee, that thou mayest be feared.","it":[[4,12]],"x":[["Jer.33.8",20,"r"],["Jer.33.9",20,"r"],["Isa.55.7",17,"r"],["Dan.9.9",15,"r"],["Ps.86.5",15,"r"],["1Kgs.8.39",14,"r"],["1Kgs.8.40",14,"r"],["Col.1.14",11,"w"],["2Cor.5.19",11,"r"],["Isa.1.18",10,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"I wait for the LORD, my soul doth wait, and in his word do I hope.","x":[["Ps.33.20",35,"r"],["Isa.30.18",33,"w"],["Ps.119.81",26,"w"],["Ps.62.5",25,"w"],["Ps.62.1",20,"r"],["Ps.27.14",19,"w"],["Ps.40.1",19,"r"],["Isa.8.17",18,"w"],["Ps.119.74",17,"r"],["Gen.49.18",16,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"My soul waiteth for the Lord more than they that watch for the morning: I say, more than they that watch for the morning.","it":[[8,15],[72,88]],"x":[["Ps.63.6",7,"r"],["Ps.119.147",7,"w"],["Isa.21.8",2,"r"],["Ps.134.1",2,"r"],["Acts.27.29",2,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Let Israel hope in the LORD: for with the LORD there is mercy, and with him is plenteous redemption.","it":[[47,55],[76,78]],"x":[["Eph.1.7",23,"w"